# Finish with fmt and lint

After any edit in this repo, before you stop or ask for a commit:

1. `make fmt`
2. `make lint`

`make fmt` is `nix fmt`. `make lint` is `nix flake check --all-systems --no-build`
(`scripts/lint.sh`). Do not skip for docs-only or small Nix.
If lint fails, fix it. GitLab format is `make fmt-check`; `make fmt` must leave
that passing. Do not hand back a dirty or unevalable tree.
